Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.31,1:32:43.23,SongJP,NTP,0,0,0,,Honey Come！！ かなえてみたい
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.31,1:32:43.23,SongCN,NTP,0,0,0,,Honey Come！！想要努力去实现
